// - R-group tokens 8-18: SafeTemperatureConstrainedStep(1.75) - higher temp for diversity
// - R-group tokens 18+: SafeTemperatureConstrainedStep(1.4) - stabilize for closure
// - minLength=12 (same as best)
//
// But attempt 18 showed temp=1.8 gave 80% syntax (10/50 invalid). 
// Temp=1.75 should be slightly better. We need > 90% syntax.
//
// ALTERNATIVE APPROACH: Use BoostedConstrainedStep to boost unusual tokens.
// Problem: requires tokens to be in lm.Tokens (not safe version).
// Use SafeBoostedConstrainedStep instead.
