// FINAL STRATEGY:
// 1. Guidance: keep short, focused, emphasize diverse structures
// 2. Scaffold (tokens 0-8): SafeSoftConstrainedStep(8.0) - stable acrylate core
// 3. R-group (tokens 8-20): SafeTemperatureConstrainedStep(1.7) - moderate diversity
// 4. Completion (tokens 20+): SafeTemperatureConstrainedStep(1.3) - stable closure
// 5. minLength=12
//
// The temperature=1.7 should give better diversity than 1.6 while avoiding the
